                                "sense_id": "06a2e7cc-1823-3329-bc68-dbc4b15a63b2",
                                "text": "Tornada są bardzo niebezpieczne."
                            }
                        ],
                        "sense_index_json": "\"1.1\""
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "dac87f52-6fa3-334a-ac98-b4dcd21c2156",
                        "entry_id": "3aaccdff-716f-3230-bf24-01a24d67b6bc",
                        "glosses": [
                            "coś gwałtownego, żywiołowego"
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "metaphoric"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "910ee6d5-a022-4cb3-8cc3-d9fcc1adc5c5",
                                "sense_id": "dac87f52-6fa3-334a-ac98-b4dcd21c2156",
                                "text": "Pomimo wielu przedsięwzięć, reżyserka, blogerka i niezależna perkusistka rockowa Eleni Vlachos jest jednoosobowym tornadem wegańskiego aktywizmu."
                            }
                        ],
                        "sense_index_json": "\"1.2\""
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "9edf33f0-d4a4-4600-b028-5d6bd5624f98",
                        "source_entry_id": "3aaccdff-716f-3230-bf24-01a24d67b6bc",
                        "source_sense_id": "06a2e7cc-1823-3329-bc68-dbc4b15a63b2",
                        "target_lang_word": "tornado",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "tornado",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "c7eb07b7-073c-3eff-b3e1-bdcf97677e78",
                                        "entry_id": "3f1f14db-3a14-3e10-91ab-e9ed213dc91e",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A violent wind in the form of a mobile, rapidly rotating, funnel cloud that has contacted the ground."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "289da82c-568a-4dc9-a230-02a55ae5d1da",
                                                "sense_id": "c7eb07b7-073c-3eff-b3e1-bdcf97677e78",
                                                "text": "An extreme version of vorticity is a vortex. The vortex is a spinning, cyclonic mass of fluid, which can be observed in the rotation of water going down a drain, as well as in smoke rings, tornados and hurricanes."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "tornado",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "a0996226-1759-3d95-8f23-78e5cf66bed0",
                                        "entry_id": "2618e014-90a6-34e0-b32f-c4634721569b",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To sweep through something violently."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "ambitransitive",
                                            "figuratively"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a3eb0355-5c83-4b01-a931-edde9b974f7b",
                                                "sense_id": "a0996226-1759-3d95-8f23-78e5cf66bed0",
                                                "text": "And so on Friday nights, James Torin tornadoed through six beers, a carton of cigarettes, a coffee table littered with lottery tickets, and unrequited dreams."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "27dc917b-840a-4c64-8d7a-3495e074e363",
                                                "sense_id": "a0996226-1759-3d95-8f23-78e5cf66bed0",
                                                "text": "They come every night,\nthose cavernous trains, tornadoing\nthe frozen house,\na madness feeling for the door."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "cc4ce7e8-5d31-4315-a5df-0f482c7f2e56",
                        "source_entry_id": "3aaccdff-716f-3230-bf24-01a24d67b6bc",
                        "source_sense_id": "06a2e7cc-1823-3329-bc68-dbc4b15a63b2",
                        "target_lang_word": "tornádo",
                        "target_lang_code": "cs",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "tornádo",
                                "target_lang_code": "cs",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "63a34bf1-e497-36d1-8530-d205edbdefb5",
                                        "entry_id": "c3edaf0c-3aaf-348a-8aa3-21b915e66756",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "mohutná smršť se sloupem rotujícího vzduchu, dotýkajícím se zemského povrchu"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3d3530f8-2e4e-45ac-88cc-1b018eeb094a",
                                                "sense_id": "63a34bf1-e497-36d1-8530-d205edbdefb5",
                                                "text": "Texasem se prohnalo silné tornádo."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "1893ca99-0766-399d-9746-4ee76c3b31af",
                                        "entry_id": "c3edaf0c-3aaf-348a-8aa3-21b915e66756",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "silná bouřka s nárazy větru"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "řidčeji"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "e327a399-2de0-4202-9f11-20b84bbcaefb",
                        "source_entry_id": "3aaccdff-716f-3230-bf24-01a24d67b6bc",
                        "source_sense_id": "06a2e7cc-1823-3329-bc68-dbc4b15a63b2",
                        "target_lang_word": "tornade",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "tornade",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "c365480f-8e47-34d8-a68a-5e90aa4d87bf",
                                        "entry_id": "fd35abdb-be3e-3ba0-9798-f9f46e7744d1",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Bourrasque violente en tourbillon."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6242f9c5-7ca9-4000-a950-b4998cd2dab3",
                                                "sense_id": "c365480f-8e47-34d8-a68a-5e90aa4d87bf",
                                                "text": "Mais qu’une tornade, qu’un grain même éclatât à ce moment, et c’était la mort presque immédiate."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "beb18f27-0873-4602-8907-8b7213e0ef77",
                                                "sense_id": "c365480f-8e47-34d8-a68a-5e90aa4d87bf",
                                                "text": "Lorsque je me suis retournée, j'ai aperçu Mina qui se dirigeait vers moi à la vitesse d'une tornade, le foulard bleu pétrole noué autour de son cou se soulevant comme les ailes d'un oiseau."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "fdab25d0-8a11-4302-a368-02b2bae101c3",
                                                "sense_id": "c365480f-8e47-34d8-a68a-5e90aa4d87bf",
                                                "text": "T'as vu tes slibars ? On dirait les voiles d'un trois-mâts après une tornade. Et ton odeur de crabe moisi, t'as senti ?"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "29d1dbe2-d66e-3857-a864-344850e5f5d9",
                                        "entry_id": "fd35abdb-be3e-3ba0-9798-f9f46e7744d1",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Quelque chose qui emporte par sa violence."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "figuratively"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1a792e89-d63d-47b7-bd0b-d3322ed43147",
                                                "sense_id": "29d1dbe2-d66e-3857-a864-344850e5f5d9",
                                                "text": "Au Mexique, ils en ont de plus piquants [des piments], une vraie tornade infernale que l’on met dans tous les plats, parfois même dans la salade de fruits."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
